Hi,

I would like to alter the TMB code in https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/laplace_8cpp-example.html
I need to find a solution to a problem using a speial kind of eigen matrices.

So: then I need to find a matrix where I evalulate the current matrix at the input parameters fixed. The current matrix is made through calling matrix<Type> <https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/structmatrix.html> H = autodiff::hessian <https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/namespaceautodiff.html#aece87159d1d7bc9099eff6b751143db4>(f, u); so I would need to typecast that matrix to the Eigen special type.

Any tips out there would be appreciated.

