One partial-solution is found at https://groups.google.com/g/tmb-users/c/vIGs97W9O1Y/m/hPdpMrCcBQAJ

 which says that

int temp_ind = CppAD::Integer(matrix_of_doubles(x,y,z));

One example to convert CppAD to eigen sparseMatrix is given at
https://coin-or.github.io/CppAD/doc/sparse2eigen.cpp.htm

